      "text": "Frontend: same-origin fetch + sesja cookie\nMutacje: X-Track-Request: 1; kontrola Origin\nGET /api/training/capabilities\nPOST /api/training → 201 {id, manifest_url}\nGET /api/runs/{id} → metrics + gpu_status\nPOST /api/training/{id}/stop → stopping\nŹródła: frontend/src/provider.ts:33;\ntraining.py:201-298",
      "originalText": "Frontend: same-origin fetch + sesja cookie\nMutacje: X-Track-Request: 1; kontrola Origin\nGET /api/training/capabilities\nPOST /api/training → 201 {id, manifest_url}\nGET /api/runs/{id} → metrics + gpu_status\nPOST /api/training/{id}/stop → stopping\nŹródła: frontend/src/provider.ts:33;\ntraining.py:201-298",
