      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793887200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GPUJob może już być finished/failed/\ncancelled, a Run nadal pozostaje aktywny.\nSupervisor: DELETE /pods/{id} (404=OK)\nDopiero potem cleanup_done=True,\nRun.state=GPUJob.state i ended_at.\nNieudane DELETE → retry po restarcie.\ngpu_training.py:397-408",
      "originalText": "GPUJob może już być finished/failed/\ncancelled, a Run nadal pozostaje aktywny.\nSupervisor: DELETE /pods/{id} (404=OK)\nDopiero potem cleanup_done=True,\nRun.state=GPUJob.state i ended_at.\nNieudane DELETE → retry po restarcie.\ngpu_training.py:397-408",
