      "text": "GET  /api/training/capabilities\nGET/POST /api/datasets\nGET  /api/datasets/{id}/content\nPOST /api/training\nGET  /api/training/{id}/manifest\nPOST /api/training/{id}/stop\nGET  /api/runs/{id}\nGET  /api/runs/{id}/checkpoints\nPOST /api/runs/{id}/benchmarks\nGET  /api/artifacts/{artifact_id}\n\n401 brak auth; 403 brak GPU; 409 kolejka;\n422 zły model/mix/czas; 404 brak własności.\nManifest użytkownika != manifest runnera.",
      "originalText": "GET  /api/training/capabilities\nGET/POST /api/datasets\nGET  /api/datasets/{id}/content\nPOST /api/training\nGET  /api/training/{id}/manifest\nPOST /api/training/{id}/stop\nGET  /api/runs/{id}\nGET  /api/runs/{id}/checkpoints\nPOST /api/runs/{id}/benchmarks\nGET  /api/artifacts/{artifact_id}\n\n401 brak auth; 403 brak GPU; 409 kolejka;\n422 zły model/mix/czas; 404 brak własności.\nManifest użytkownika != manifest runnera.",
